## Architecture

- **Feature-first layers** (`data`, `presentation`)
- **Riverpod** state management
- **GoRouter** navigation with typed routes
- **Dio** API client with a mock interceptor
- **Material 3** light/dark themes

## Replacing the mock API

Set `USE_MOCK_API=false` and `API_BASE_URL` at build time:

```bash
flutter run \
  --dart-define=USE_MOCK_API=false \
  --dart-define=API_BASE_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
```

The mock interceptor lives in `lib/core/api/mock_interceptor.dart`.

